### Create Health Twin
POST http://localhost:8080/api/health-twins
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "patientId": "patient-001",
  "patientName": "John Doe",
  "age": 36,
  "gender": "male",
  "conditions": [
    "Hypertension"
  ],
  "medications": [
    "Amlodipine"
  ]
}

### Get All Health Twins
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health-twins

### Get Health Twin for Patient
GET http://localhost:8080/api/health-twins/patient-001